# Helm
*.tgz
chart/charts/
chart/Chart.lock

# Generated by working-sessions/scripts/create-custom-domain-configs.sh — regenerate rather
# than commit, so the company.net policies stay the single source of truth. The script
# writes <domain>-nonprod-namespaceconfig-rbac.yaml into the CURRENT directory, so anchor
# these to the repo root with a leading slash.
#
# They were previously unanchored ("*-nonprod-..."), which also matched real tracked files
# such as namespaceconfig-nonprod-namespaceconfig-rbac.yaml under
# working-sessions/docs/planning/helmify-policies/exported/ — silently excluding them from
# the index. The old "!policies/..." negations no longer applied either, since that
# directory moved under working-sessions/. Anchoring removes the need for negations.
/*-nonprod-namespaceconfig-rbac.yaml
/*-prod-namespaceconfig-rbac.yaml

# Cluster dumps and scratch output
*.log
*.tmp
/tmp/
kubeconfig
.kubeconfig

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
